        r"""$g'(x)=\dfrac{x^2-2x-1}{(x-1)^2}$""",
        r"""Quotient rule: $\frac{2x(x-1)-(x^2+1)\cdot1}{(x-1)^2}=\frac{x^2-2x-1}{(x-1)^2}$.""",
